# Line endings (standards/12). Most files run inside Linux containers: shell scripts, Nginx/MediaMTX
# config, Dockerfiles and env files break with Windows CRLF, so checkouts keep LF on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# Binary files: never converted.
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.onnx binary
